+// firmware). Callable before or after finalize_config.
+// The caller sets up the pins (local pins with gpio_out_setup_local): step
+// at its unstep level ('invert_step > 0' means high), dir low. The caller
+// is responsible for the pins and for refusing an invalid configuration
